{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "00fac041-9c49-87f3-8f4a-da3f5e40b1dc",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T14:17:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:14:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. My name is Nicholas Cardillo. I'm calling about a pothole, on behalf of my mother. I have you on speaker, I've got my notes in front of me, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:15:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Go ahead, I'll take it down as you go. Where's the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:15:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 29 Howard Street. That's in the Fifth Ward. My mother lives at that address, and the hole is right in the street in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:15:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 29 Howard Street, in the road out front. How big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:15:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's deep. I'd say deep enough to swallow a tire. I wrote down roughly two feet across, but I didn't have a tape measure, so that's an estimate. It got worse after last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. I noticed it Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:15:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Worse since the weekend, about two feet across, deep enough to take a tire. Has anybody had damage from it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:15:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A neighbor hit it. [pause] That's the man across the street. He said it jolted the whole car. I don't know if there was any damage, he didn't say. I'm just reporting what he told my mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:16:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note a neighbor hit it. Is it in the travel lane or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check my note. Travel lane, on the side of the street where my mother's house is. Closer to the middle than the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. That's enough for me to put in a work order. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just one thing. Could I get a reference number for this? I like to keep a record. I'm retired, so I keep a folder on everything. I used to spend my lunch hour at a bookstore on Thames Street back when I worked, and I got in the habit of writing things down in a little notebook. Anyway, a reference number would help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, let me pull it up. [pause] Okay, I've got the request entered. Your reference number is 4471. That's four, four, seven, one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:16:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four, four, seven, one. Thank you. And a callback number, in case you need it, is 401-555-0159."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0159. Crews will look at it as they get through the list. They've got a lot of repairs after the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:17:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Thank you, Kevin. That's all I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:17:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
